// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P4094318327" "The illusion of the {PowerName} has faded."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Blind 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1662844480" "Ranged (Targeted AoE), Moderate DMG(Psionic), Foe Hold/Sleep"
// Power Help Text :
"P3382368633" "Painfully Blinds a single targeted foe so severely that he is rendered helpless. Blind is so bright that additional foes may also be blinded, though they will not take any damage, and attacking them will free them from the effects. Damage: Moderate, Recharge: Moderate"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P3463939617" "Hold, Sleep"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P46497870" "{PlayerSource} Blinds you for {Damage} points of Psionic damage."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Deceive 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2764087641" "Deceive"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P4115063526" "Ranged, Foe Confuse"
// Power Help Text :
"P1289220157" "You can Deceive an enemy into believing his friends are not who they appear to be. If successful, the enemy will ignore you and attack his own allies. If you Deceive someone before they have noticed you, your presence will continue to be masked. You will not receive any Experience Points for foes defeated by a Deceived enemy. Recharge: Moderate"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P1116895679" "Confuse"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P3246574055" "You have been confused.  You may attack an incorrect target."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Flash 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1846505479" "Flash"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P646414368" "PBAoE, Foe Hold"
// Power Help Text :
"P1761396185" "Generates a brilliant flash of light around you that blinds nearby foes. Flashed foes are rendered helpless and unable to defend themselves. Recharge: Very Long"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Spectral Army 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3648447892" "Spectral Army"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2733991276" "Summon Spectral Army: Ranged Minor DMG(Energy/Special)"
// Power Help Text :
"P1805668487" "You can fabricate 2 to 4 Phantom heroes around a targeted foe. These Phantoms are not real, and are indestructible. Their attacks are similar to Spectral Wounds. Though they deal damage, it is illusory and will heal if the victim survives long enough. Phantoms are short lived and cannot be buffed or healed. Recharge: Very Long"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Spectral Terror 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1561232778" "Spectral Terror"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P4194083598" "Summon Terror: Ranged Fear"
// Power Help Text :
"P3700068927" "You can create an illusion of unspeakable Terror. The manifestation is so horrible that it caused most foes to tremble helplessly in terror. The Spectral Terror may also Terrify individual foes, causing them to run away in panic. Recharge: Slow"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P4271146106" "You are terrified."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Spectral Servant 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P779544477" "Spectral Servant"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1727404869" "Summon Spectral Servant: Ranged Moderate DAM (Energy)"
// Power Help Text :
"P900110828" "You can construct a powerful entity composed of pure light. Although made of light, the Phantasm is tangible and has powerful Energy attacks. The Phantasm can also fly and summon duplicates of itself. The duplicates are intangible, and cannot be harmed. The duplicates' attacks deal illusory damage similar to that dealt by Spectral Wounds. Only the original Phantasm can be healed and buffed. Recharge: Very Long"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
